  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The angry protest scene is mapped onto the claim that Islam is a religion of peace",
  "description": "The visual material of the angry protest scene (man_in_foreground shouting and pointing aggressively, surrounded by other angry protesters holding green flags) is juxtaposed with the textual claim 'islam is a religion of peace if you don't agree then you're ignorant'. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual representation of anger and aggression is used to imply that the claim about Islam being a religion of peace is false or invalid. The mapping suggests that if one disagrees with the claim, they are ignorant, and the visual of anger is used to discredit the claim by association.",
